        <definition>typedef struct AVContainerFifo AVContainerFifo</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>AVContainerFifo</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>AVContainerFifo is a FIFO for &quot;containers&quot; - dynamically allocated reusable structs (e.g. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structAVFrame" kindref="compound">AVFrame</ref> or <ref refid="structAVPacket" kindref="compound">AVPacket</ref>). AVContainerFifo uses an internal pool of such containers to avoid allocating and freeing them repeatedly. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
